{
  "schema": "phx.learning-science.pedagogy.v1",
  "spec": "SPEC-V2-2224",
  "note": "The shared pedagogy classes' data. scripts/learning-science-probe.py reads every list here and branches on no language code: a genre, a section id, a threshold or a language's pattern is a row, never a code branch. Duties are persona-core's registry ids; a duty pack calls these classes and never copies this table.",
